==================================================
PROBLEM 1 — REMOVE "PLAY AGAIN"
==================================================

After completing a minion or boss, there is currently a "Play Again" option.

REMOVE THIS OPTION FROM THE PROGRESSION FLOW.

It is currently dangerous because pressing "Play Again" sends the player back toward the boss/previous battle instead of continuing the intended progression. This can create loops and contradictory navigation.

We do NOT want the player to replay the previous battle from this completion screen.

Instead, completion screens must provide the correct NEXT-PROGRESSION action.

For example:

Lesson 1 completed
→ option to go to Minion 1

Minion 1 completed
→ option to go to Lesson 2

Lesson 2 completed
→ option to go to Minion 2

Minion 2 completed
→ option to go to Lesson 3

Lesson 3 completed
→ option to go to Minion 3

Minion 3 completed
→ option to go to Boss 1

Boss 1 completed
→ option to continue to the NEXT appropriate lesson/progression step

Use the same type of navigation logic that is already working correctly between Lesson 1 and Minion 1.

The important point is:

COMPLETION → NEXT PROGRESSION

NOT:

COMPLETION → PLAY AGAIN → PREVIOUS/WRONG BATTLE

If the exact next destination cannot safely be determined at a particular completion screen, send the player to the Home page rather than sending them back into a previous battle.

Do NOT leave a button that can send the player into the wrong battle.

